# FreeRADIUS local dictionary — attributes that only OUR platform uses.
#
# TEMPLATE: scripts/wsl/03-configure-freeradius.sh installs it as
# /etc/freeradius/3.0/dictionary (the distro's copy is only comments; the
# original is kept as dictionary.orig). FreeRADIUS loads this file after its
# built-in dictionaries. 3000-3999 is the range reserved for local attributes.
#
# Max-Total-Octets is a CHECK item (it goes in radcheck, never sent to the
# router). It is the TOTAL data allowance a user bought, in bytes, up + down
# combined. 64-bit, so plans larger than 4 GB work.
#
# The matching "used so far" counter (Total-Octets-Used) is created by the
# sqlcounter module itself — do NOT declare it here or FreeRADIUS refuses to start.

ATTRIBUTE	Max-Total-Octets		3010	integer64